;Gallery Music declaration. Assigned music are selectable via Gallery Mode
;submenu ('menu.itemname.gallery' parameter in screenpack DEF file)

;Declaring music consists of setting up following parameters:

; - id (required)
;	Set to name that should be stored for use with unlocks paramvalue.
;	This parameter also initiates new music declaration, so it has to be
;	assigned before any other parameter used by the same music.
;	All music should have unique id names.

; - path (required)
;	Set Path to file with song (relative to game directory).
;	containing music file to play.

; - volume (optional)
;	Set default music volume scale. 100 is for 100% (default: 100)

; - loopstart (optional)
;	Set music loop start sample number. (default: 0)

; - loopend (optional)
;	Set music loop end sample number. (default: 0)

; - previewspr (only used in main gallery screen) [optional]
;	Set groupNo and indexNo to load from sff file defined in "music.spr"
;	system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue, to show preview sprite for items.
;	If is not defined, "preview.unknown.music.spr" will be displayed.

; - previewsize (only used in main gallery screen) [optional]
;	Set Width and Height of for gallery preview sprite defined in previewspr paramvalue.
;	If is not defined, "preview.music.size" system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue will be used.

; - previewpos (only used in main gallery screen) [optional]
;	Set posX and posY for gallery preview sprite which is the same defined in previewspr paramvalue.
;	If is not defined, "preview.music.offset" system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue will be used.

; - previewspacing (only used in main gallery screen) [optional]
;	Set spacingX and spacingY for gallery preview sprite which is the same defined in previewspr paramvalue.
;	If is not defined, "preview.music.spacing" system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue will be used.

; - previewscale (only used in main gallery screen) [optional]
;	Set scaleX and scaleY for gallery preview sprite which is the same defined in previewspr paramvalue.
;	If is not defined, "preview.music.scale" system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue will be used.

; - info (optional)
;	Set to description that should be displayed for music selected.
;	If is not defined, "info.unknown.text" system.def [Gallery Info] paramvalue will be used.

; - unlock (optional)
;	Pure Lua code, executed exactly as is, each time upon loading gallery menu.
;	If it evaluates to boolean 'true' the music will be selectable from
;	gallery mode submenu, or hidden on 'false'. Default: true.
;	https://github.com/ikemen-engine/Ikemen-GO/wiki/Lua#content-unlocking

;Examples:

[GalleryMusic]
id = music 1
path = external/mods/gallery/Itty Bitty 8 Bit.mp3
info = Itty Bitty 8 Bit - Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)

id = music 2
path = external/mods/gallery/Special Spotlight.mp3
info = Special Spotlight - Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com)